<title>USA: Intellicell hires John Snyder as CFO.</title>
<headline>Intellicell hires John Snyder as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>VAN NUYS, Calif. 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>- Intellicell Corp said Tuesday it had hired John Snyder as its chief financial officer.</p>
<p>It said Snyder previously was chief financial officer of Cleveland Wrecking Company and of Pedus Services, a human resource provider, adding he is a certified public accountant formerly of the accounting firm of Deloitte &amp; Touche.</p>
<p>Snyder will report directly to James Bunting, chief operating officer, the company said.</p>
<p>((- New York Newsdesk, 212 859-1610))</p>
